# Shell scripts must stay LF regardless of the checking-out platform's
# core.autocrlf -- a CRLF-converted shebang/script body breaks execution
# under bash (Git Bash, WSL, Linux, macOS) even though it looks harmless in
# an editor. Scoped narrowly rather than repo-wide so this doesn't change
# line-ending behavior for anything else.
scripts/*.sh text eol=lf
